{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44033","headline":"铜雀台 · 梁琼","name":"铜雀台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"歌扇向陵开，齐行奠玉杯。\n舞时飞燕列，梦里片云来。\n月色空余恨，松声莫更哀。\n谁怜未死妾，掩袂下铜台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁琼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}